      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u25CF<indent=10>A shell and tube heat exchanger is a device constructed
    using a large cylindrical enclosure, or shell, that has bundles of tubing compacted
    in its interior, where one fluid flows through the tubes while the other fluid
    flows through the shell and exchanges their temperature without getting mixed
    with the help of baffles tubes.</indent>\n\u25CF<indent=10>The shell and tube
    heat exchangers have a simple design, low maintenance, and a very high heat transfer
    rate.</indent>\n\n\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e63ac0177aeed334f9a24408402d8fb6, type: 2}
